ic publication, thesis, or patent innovation.',80.00,NULL,1,'archived','SYSTEM_OPERATIONALIZATION','LEGACY_QUARANTINED',0,'1.0',NULL,'2026-08-28 03:46:27.003045','2026-08-30 22:29:24.558137'),('50000001-0000-0000-0000-000000000013','LOYALTY_AWARD','Institutional Loyalty Award','loyalty','Continuous holistic formation and residency in the institution.',80.00,NULL,1,'archived','SYSTEM_OPERATIONALIZATION','LEGACY_QUARANTINED',0,'1.0',NULL,'2026-08-28 03:46:27.003045','2026-08-30 22:29:24.558137'),('50000001-0000-0000-0000-000000000014','DEANS_MEDAL_OF_DISTINCTION','Dean Medal of Distinction','collegiate','Collegiate-level highest recognition awarded by the College Dean.',80.00,NULL,1,'archived','OFFICIAL','LEGACY_QUARANTINED',0,'1.0',NULL,'2026-08-28 03:46:27.003045','2026-08-30 22:29:24.558137'),('50000001-0000-0000-0000-000000000015','PRESIDENTS_MEDAL_OF_EXCELLENCE','President Medal of Excellence','presidential','Supreme university commendation for character, scholarship, and service.',80.00,NULL,1,'archived','OFFICIAL','LEGACY_QUARANTINED',0,'1.0',NULL,'2026-08-28 03:46:27.003045','2026-08-30 22:29:24.558137'),('50000001-0000-0000-0000-000000000021','SMC_AWARD','Saint Marcellin Champagnat (SMC) Award','service','Premier graduating award recognizing exceptional Christian leadership, apostolic zeal, Marist spirituality, and service to Church and community.',80.00,NULL,1,'active','OFFICIAL','VERIFIED',1,'1.0',NULL,'2026-08-30 22:29:24.562263','2026-08-30 22:55:40.648600'),('50000001-0000-0000-0000-000000000022','LEADERSHIP_AWARD','Leadership Award','leadership','Premier graduating award recognizing exemplary executive student governance, organizational stewardship, civic involvement, and church community leadership.',80.00,NULL,1,'active','OFFICIAL','VERIFIED',1,'1.0',NULL,'2026-08-30 22:29:24.566896','2026-08-30 23:13:08.662770'),('50000001-0000-0000-0000-000000000023','CAMPUS_JOURNALISM_AWARD','Campus Journalism Award','journalism','Premier graduating award recognizing exemplary journalistic dedication, verified publication excellence, editorial integrity, and campus publication leadership.',80.00,NULL,1,'active','OFFICIAL','VERIFIED',1,'1.0',NULL,'2026-08-30 22:29:24.570223','2026-08-30 23:31:08.514850'),('50000001-0000-0000-0000-000000000024','SPORTS_AWARD_FEMALE','Outstanding Performance in Sports - Female','sports','Premier graduating award recognizing exemplary female athletic distinction, verified tournament competition excellence, medal honors, sportsmanship, and leadership.',80.00,'female',1,'active','OFFICIAL','VERIFIED',1,'1.0',NULL,'2026-08-30 22:29:24.573505','2026-08-30 23:36:59.384207'),('50000001-0000-0000-0000-000000000025','SPORTS_AWARD_MALE','Outstanding Performance in Sports - Male','sports','Premier graduating award recognizing exemplary male athletic distinction, verified tournament competition excellence, medal honors, sportsmanship, and leadership.',80.00,'male',1,'active','OFFICIAL','VERIFIED',1,'1.0',NULL,'2026-08-30 22:29:24.576460','2026-08-30 23:44:38.170526'),('50000001-0000-0000-0000-000000000026','SOCIO_CULTURAL_AWARD_FEMALE','Outstanding Performance in Socio-Cultural - Female','socio_cultural','Proposed AchieveNest portfolio-based criteria recognizing exemplary female performing arts distinction, cultural competition excellence, stage discipline, and institutional artistic representation.',80.00,'female',1,'active','PROPOSED','VERIFIED',1,'1.0',NULL,'2026-08-30 22:29:24.579991','2026-08-30 23:52:01.527082'),('50000001-0000-0000-0000-000000000027','SOCIO_CULTURAL_AWARD_MALE','Outstanding Performance in Socio-Cultural - Male','socio_cultural','Proposed AchieveNest portfolio-based criteria recognizing exemplary male performing arts distinction, cultural competition excellence, stage discipline, and institutional artistic representation.',80.00,'male',1,'active','PROPOSED','VERIFIED',1,'1.0',NULL,'2026-08-30 22:29:24.583817','2026-08-30 23:58:58.574936'),('50000001-0000-0000-0000-000000000028','STUDENT_LEADER_OF_THE_YEAR','Outstanding Student Leader of the Year','leadership','Premier annual institutional leadership award honoring an exceptional student leader who manifests moral character, satisfactory academic performance with no failing grades, university/community impact, and organizational excellence.',80.00,NULL,0,'active','OFFICIAL','VERIFIED',1,'1.0',NULL,'2026-08-30 22:29:24.587500','2026-08-31 00:06:32.037729'),('50000001-0000-0000-0000-000000000029','MEMBER_OF_THE_YEAR','Outstanding Member of the Year','organization','Premier annual institutional award honoring an active member of a recognized student organization who has manifested outstanding membership commitment, significant contribution, leadership, and moral character.',80.00,NULL,0,'active','OFFICIAL','VERIFIED',1,'1.0',NULL,'2026-08-30 22:29:24.591848','2026-08-31 00:13:47.621128'),('50000001-0000-0000-0000-000000000030','VOLUNTEER_OF_THE_YEAR','Outstanding Volunteer of the Year','community','Premier annual institutional award honoring an exceptional student who has excelled in volunteerism work, community extension programs, and church/ministry engagement while maintaining moral character and academic performance.',80.00,NULL,0,'active','OFFICIAL','VERIFIED',1,'1.0',NULL,'2026-08-30 22:29:24.596689','2026-08-31 00:20:39.937583'),('50000001-0000-0000-0000-000000000031','ATHLETE_OF_THE_YEAR_FEMALE','Outstanding Athlete of the Year - Female','sports','Premier annual institutional athletic award honoring an exceptional female athlete who has excelled in sports competitions, manifested sportsmanship and attitude, and maintained moral character with no failing grades.',80.00,'female',0,'active','OFFICIAL','VERIFIED',1,'1.0',NULL,'2026-08-30 22:29:24.600644','2026-08-31 00:28:40.948398'),('50000001-0000-0000-0000-000000000032','ATHLETE_OF_THE_YEAR_MALE','Outstanding Athlete of the Year - Male','sports','Premier annual institutional athletic award honoring an exceptional male athlete who has excelled